(text "4-CH MUSCLE WIRE (SMA) CONSTANT-CURRENT DRIVER  -  AD5593R + MCP6002 + IRLML6344" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 149.86 274.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "466aaa4e-f6e9-4c6f-b656-e6e43aaee950"))
(text "DAC: I/O0-I/O3 = SET1-4, range 0-VREF (2.5V int ref, EN_REF=1). ADC: I/O4-I/O7 = ADC1-4, range 0-2xVREF." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 149.86 279.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "a4ed484f-1182-40af-9dce-173e31dcdd36"))
(text "I = VSET / 1R0.  300 mA max per channel => VSET <= 300 mV (codes 0-491 of 4095)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 149.86 284.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "65d183c7-f4a6-4633-bf86-9c809f531be3"))
(text "I2C address 0x10 (A0 low) / 0x11 (A0 high). D5 lights when board is selected via A0." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 149.86 289.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "ae0f6d3c-be87-4c9f-9f89-79b92f2de894"))
(text "Load path: +10V -> muscle wire -> DRAINx (J2). VCC = 3.2-5.0 V. VLOGIC tied to VCC." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 149.86 294.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "14ef6f2b-82d0-415b-9f66-f29d49a0201c"))
(text "FORM FACTOR: 8 x ~70 mm strip, 0.8 mm PCB, parts one side, fits 10 mm ID tube." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 149.86 299.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "f8e80803-6fa3-4d3d-b112-decaf772174d"))
(text "J1 = JST SH 6P side-entry (in). J2 = JST SH 4P side-entry (out)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 149.86 304.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "dbc7431e-524e-4c00-bee4-da391c7a3420"))
